WEBVTT

00:08:59.248 --> 00:09:01.899
Mislim, kako dolgo so ga gradili?

00:09:01.899 --> 00:09:08.170
Res je--tako da, uuuu. (Smeh)

00:09:10.081 --> 00:09:12.318
Nekako imamo glavno pravilo,

00:09:12.318 --> 00:09:14.519
da mi nikdar ne povedo, kako daleč je še,

00:09:14.519 --> 00:09:15.811
ker ne vemo, kako daleč je še.

00:09:15.811 --> 00:09:17.143
Kaj se ti bo zgodilo

00:09:17.143 --> 00:09:18.921
med to točko in drugo točko.

00:09:18.921 --> 00:09:20.433
Kaj bo z vremenom

00:09:20.433 --> 00:09:23.624
in tokovi, in, bog ne daj, da te piči,

00:09:23.624 --> 00:09:26.906
ko misliš, da te v tem oklepu
nič ne more pičiti,

00:09:26.906 --> 00:09:29.413
in Bonnie se je odločila

00:09:29.413 --> 00:09:32.572
na prehodu v tretje jutro,